<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-SPAIN BEAT DENMARK IN DAVIS CUP WORLD GROUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SPAIN BEAT DENMARK IN DAVIS CUP WORLD GROUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TARRAGONA, Spain</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain beat Denmark 4-1 in a Davis Cup world group qualifying round match which ended on Sunday.</p>
<p>Sunday's results (Spanish names first):</p>
<p>Carlos Moya beat Thomas Larsen 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Alberto Costa lost to Kenneth Carlsen 6-3 5-7 3-6</p>
</text>
